kome.lordship.objective.relief_force=Lead the Liege's relief force to %s. Protect the refuge and defeat its attackers.
kome.lordship.objective.border_patrol=Take the Liege's patrol to %s. Find and defeat the hostile incursion.
kome.lordship.objective.protected_expedition=See your charge safely to %s with the Liege's guards. Overcome the reported danger on the road.
kome.lordship.survivors=Keep at least %s of the %s entrusted soldiers alive and with you when the charge is fulfilled.
kome.lordship.commands=Sneak and speak with a guard to order them to wait or follow. They remain your Liege's people.
kome.lordship.follow=I remain under your charge. Speak while sneaking to order me to wait or follow.
kome.lordship.wait=I shall wait here until you call me to follow again.
kome.lordship.report=Your charge is fulfilled. Bring the surviving force back to your Liege and report personally for appointment to Lordship.
kome.lordship.failed=This charge has failed. Return to your Liege to account for it and seek another trial.
kome.lordship.ready=You have earned the right to be tested. Ask your Liege for the Trial of Lordship.
kome.lordship.preparing=Complete three different commissions and hold 2,000 current faction alignment before seeking the Trial of Lordship.
kome.lordship.seek_liege=Seek an appropriate replacement Liege to receive your service and any completed trial report.
kome.lordship.speech.offer=You have served faithfully when sent alone. Now I entrust my people to your charge: %s. %s
kome.lordship.speech.failed=The charge was not fulfilled. My people will be recalled. Return and account for what happened; your earlier service remains honoured.
kome.lordship.speech.retry=I have heard your account. Your earlier service stands. When you are ready, speak with me for another trial.
kome.lordship.speech.standing=Your trial remains honoured, but your faction must currently hold you in sufficient regard. Return with at least 2,000 faction alignment and three completed commissions.
kome.lordship.speech.promoted=You have served faithfully when sent alone and proved worthy of responsibility for others. I appoint you %s. You now hold authority to capture hostile holdings and reclaim faction holdings under the existing rules.

kome.lordship.speech.bring_survivors=Bring at least half of the entrusted soldiers back within sight, then give me your account.
kome.lordship.report_recalled=Your fulfilled charge remains honoured. The force has been recalled by the faction. Return personally to your current Liege to report the trial.

